dashboard.definition:
{
	"title": "Network Activation Report v2",
	"description": "Client health and Catalyst Center reports network activation operations.",
	"inputs": {
		"input_time_range": {
			"options": {
				"defaultValue": "-24h@h,now",
				"token": "time_tok"
			},
			"type": "input.timerange"
		}
	},
	"defaults": {
		"dataSources": {
			"ds.search": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$time_tok.earliest$",
						"latest": "$time_tok.latest$"
					}
				}
			}
		},
		"tokens": {
			"default": {}
		}
	},
	"visualizations": {
		"viz_about_bg": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_about_hdr_title": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#005073",
				"fontSize": "large",
				"markdown": "# Dashboard Metrics Overview"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_about_purpose": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "# Statewide Network Exercise\n\nComprehensive view of **client connectivity and network readiness** across all statewide sites. Use this dashboard to validate operational posture, compare site performance, and support readiness exercises.\n\n**Audience:** Network Operations, Field Engineers, IT Leadership\n**Primary Sources:** Cisco Catalyst Center (DNAC) — Client Health, Device Health, AP Health\n**Refresh:** All panels follow the global time picker; client health data refreshes every 15 minutes\n\n---\n\n## How to Navigate This Dashboard\n\n**Overview** — Wired and wireless client trends, health scores, and connection counts across all sites.\n*Start here — confirm client onboarding is healthy statewide.*\n\n**Executive Summary** — Aggregated KPIs, site health rankings, and trend indicators for leadership briefings.\n*Use for operational readiness reviews and cross-site comparisons.*\n\n**Client Summary** — Device types, OS distribution, connection methods, and per-site client breakdowns.\n*Drill in to identify client population shifts and troubleshoot device-specific issues.*\n\n> **Reading pattern:** Healthy client counts + green health scores = normal ops. Dropping counts or degraded scores = switch to Client Summary for device-level root cause."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_about_sources": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Data Sources & Troubleshooting\n\n---\n\n**Cisco Catalyst Center** — Cisco DNA Center App for Splunk\nSourcetypes: `cisco:dnac:clienthealth`, `cisco:dnac:networkhealth`, `cisco:dnac:devicehealth`\nFreshness: ~15 min\n\n**Cisco Catalyst Center (AP)** — Cisco DNA Center App for Splunk\nSourcetypes: `cisco:dnac:aphealth`\nFreshness: ~15 min\n\n---\n\n**Panel showing \"No results\"?**\n\n1. **Widen the time range** — client health data needs at least 4 hours\n2. **Verify the DNAC App is installed** — check *Manage Apps*\n3. **Confirm data flow** — run `index=* sourcetype=cisco:dnac:clienthealth | head 5`\n4. **Check saved search status** — verify scheduled searches are enabled."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_box_cl_activity": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_cl_health": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_cl_location": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_cl_session": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_cl_traffic": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_cl_trend": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_cl_wireless": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_ex_client": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
