		"viz_info_cl": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Client Summary Tab\n\n---\n\n**Client Health Score** — Composite client health\n**Total Connected Clients** — Active client count\n**Wireless vs Wired** — Client type distribution\n**Health Distribution** — Good/Fair/Poor breakdown\n\n---\n\n**Client Count Over Time** — Health distribution trend\n\n---\n\n**Top Networks by Client Count** — Busiest network segments\n**Client Health by Location** — Per-site client health\n**Clients by Device Type** — Device category breakdown\n\n---\n\n**Client OS Distribution** — Operating system breakdown\n**Connection Type Breakdown** — Wired vs wireless vs VPN\n**Top SSIDs by Client Count** — Busiest wireless networks"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_ex": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Executive Summary Tab\n\n---\n\n#### Device & Network Health\n\n**Healthy Devices** — Count of devices in good health\n**Network Health** — Overall network health percentage\n**Access Points** — Total AP count\n**AP Reachability** — Percentage of APs responding\n\n---\n\n**Network Health Trend** — Health score over time\n**Sites with Lowest/Highest Health** — Best and worst performing sites\n\n---\n\n#### Client Health\n\n**Client Health** — Composite client health score\n**Client Health Trend** — Client score over time\n**Sites with Lowest/Highest Client Health** — Site rankings by client health\n\n---\n\n#### Site-Level Summary\n\n**Device Health by Site** — Per-site device health scores\n**Client Health by Site** — Per-site client health scores\n**AP Count by Site** — Access point distribution"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_ov": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Overview Tab\n\n---\n\n**Wireless Health** — Composite wireless client health score\n**Wireless Clients** — Total connected wireless clients\n**Healthy (Wireless)** — Count of wireless clients in good health\n**Wired Health** — Composite wired client health score\n**Wired Clients** — Total connected wired clients\n**Healthy (Wired)** — Count of wired clients in good health\n\n---\n\n**Wireless Client Trend (24h)** — Wireless client count over time\n**Wired Client Trend (24h)** — Wired client count over time"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
